{"title": "非洲紫罗兰原生质体的制备及不同组分培养基对细胞增殖的影响", "authors": "陈鑫 ; 李骏 ; 余汝媛 ; 张扬 ; 赖育菠 ; 陈志宽 ; 罗俊明 ; 陆幸妍 ; 广东药学院生命科学与生物制药学院", "orgs": "", "source": "广东药学院学报", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "非洲紫罗兰 ; 愈伤组织 ; 悬浮细胞系 ; 原生质体 ; 细胞增殖", "abstract": "目的探讨非洲紫罗兰(Saintpaulia ionantha)原生质体的制备方法,并比较不同组分培养基对原生质体再生及增殖的影响。方法以非洲紫罗兰愈伤组织制备悬浮细胞,以细胞生长曲线确定最佳培养时间,并将纤维素酶(cellulase R-10)和果胶酶(pectinase Y-23)按2∶1(质量比)混合分别酶解悬浮细胞18、21、24 h,比较原生质体得率和细胞活力以确定最佳酶解时间。分别以愈伤组织提取物、根尖提取物及培养土浸出物配制培养基培养原生质体16 d,观察原生质体细胞壁再生并比较细胞增殖率。结果悬浮细胞培养8 d细胞增殖率最大,细胞活力93.8%;4%(质量分数)纤维素酶和2%(质量分数)果胶酶混合酶解21 h原生质体得率达到峰值,细胞活力为75.2%,延长至24 h后得率与21 h相比,差异无统计学意义,但细胞活力降至69.5%。以不同组分培养基培养原生质体,最早于第6天在愈伤组织提取物培养基中观察到再生细胞壁及细胞分裂;第16天,愈伤组织和根尖提取物培养基细胞增殖率显著高于原生质体基础培养基和培养土浸出物培养基,并以愈伤组织为佳,而培养土浸出物无促进作用。结论以非洲紫罗...", "doi": "", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "2011年广东药学院校级教学改革自由申报项目；", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLx2qwNbKLSByeWb_ucdLD9-KOM1PAJLL4oCUbpKULliIiyB8pgmI63mJElcgsTF0g4J4NSmfdb1DfTJQ8cQT-VPKfEBsgr0FW_XUn4YcCbIi2GkQcunDBvhGlEbHXAmpqF9wlWwopBVNeCwfyd26pNUgiCBP90ct77ZWNyKu5dRGA==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "647fac76a88f"}
{"title": "腰骨藤的植物化学和药理学研究进展(英文)", "authors": "Narendra Kumar Singh ; V. P. Singh ; Department of Medicinal Chemistry, Faculty of Ayurveda, Institute of Medical Sciences, Banaras Hindu University, Varanasi-221005, India", "orgs": "", "source": "中国天然药物", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "", "abstract": "Ichnocarpus frutescens R. Br. (Apocynaceae), is a woody climbing shrub, found almost in all parts of India. In India, tribes used this plant as a substitute of Indian Sarsaparilla (Hemidesmus indicus) for the treatment of atrophy, convulsions, cough, delirium, dysentery, measles, splenomegaly, tuberculosis, tumor, diabetes as a lactogogue, antipyretic, demulcent, diaphoretic and in skin diseases. Phytochemical investigations indicate that 28 compounds reported from the plant belong to various ch...", "doi": "", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLw7yZOq1Ghi93QcJYmuZyi305VTSid-_Il9l_Gb-RgHHD8-_Gt4fLJWA39PzScAqcwqm13tc3ic_VNMqs1gONzOMiSP3N6iFUoqTYuZHXsLKpnfgYrELpu6y00iKdEId7Kz7jAwTK-nAnkMYXlrRtEPXSWofTpLf8BBr4xZmjXsUA==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "18a9e96b564e"}
{"title": "关于我国生药学发展的思考", "authors": "王德群 ; 安徽省高校现代中药重点实验室,安徽中医学院药学院", "orgs": "", "source": "药学教育", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "生药学 ; 中药生药学 ; 学科发展", "abstract": "回顾生药学传入我国对中药发展的重大作用。建议根据我国特色,建立起一个统一的、可包容多学科的中药生药学学科,并将古今研究方法融为一体,为我国医药学发展作出新的贡献。", "doi": "10.16243/j.cnki.32-1352/g4.2012.03.017", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "国家中医药管理局药用植物学重点学科建设项目；", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLyfNs6Z2yHrcqwaVQRM1N0T-KOWVIHFzTlclHdjPycVxlp601mrUEFVP0KrCfewWcwx1bkbJMhIMXBTIcc269vGX0GyvlI-5KgLVxLXPu4RAkQyphWGMVJqKcTkM8GvHczKRg-UgYsLcLbY5y9rkq22qVxwMidCKdP_tfAxOAK1dw==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "bec672498682"}
{"title": "《印度阿育吠陀药典》所载药物与中国相应传统药物的比较(续三)", "authors": "贾敏如 ; 王张 ; 邝婷婷 ; 张艺 ; 成都中医药大学民族医药学院", "orgs": "", "source": "中国民族医药杂志", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "印度阿育吠陀药典 ; 药物 ; 比较", "abstract": "<正>续《<印度阿育吠陀药典>(API)所载药物与中国相应传统药物的比较(续二)》一文,详见表1。本续主要内容提示:前文已述,印度政府是1990～2008年先后完成出版这部具民族医学体系的药典,共分2部:第一部为单味药", "doi": "10.16041/j.cnki.cn15-1175.2012.05.039", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "国家自然科学基金项目(30973957)；", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLyfNs6Z2yHrcqwaVQRM1N0T-KOWVIHFzTkFK6ZTcN1rI17-o5rc8n0JdcD-K2gopCkQrzl6gKRudY_jGul6GXfb3dkD6nFgCzfAianVO0WPj3QACpPayXDV9iwSWo52rJ9b9rEBX0-oHs-TAs_DnyebTm9dNUNMVfFKvWn-6PEFzg==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "23e947c33b68"}
{"title": "Cynodon dactylon andSida acuta extracts impact on the function of the cardiovascular system in zebrafish embryos OA", "authors": "Rajaretinam Rajesh Kannan ; Samuel Gnana Prakash Vincent ; International Center for Nanobiotechnology (ICN),Center for Marine Science and Technology (CMST),Manonmaniam Sundaranar University,Rajakkamangalam,Kanyakumari Dist,Tamil Nadu 629502,India", "orgs": "", "source": "Journal of Biomedical Research", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "", "abstract": "The aim of the present study was to screen cardioactive herbs from Western Ghats of India.The heart beat rate (HBR) and blood flow during systole and diastole were tested in zebrafish embryos.We found that Cynodon dactylon (C.dactylon) induced increases in the HBR in zebrafish embryos with a HBR of (3.968±0.344) beats/s,which was significantly higher than that caused by betamethosone [(3.770±0.344) beats/s].The EC 50 value of C.dactylon was 3.738 μg/mL.The methanolic extract of Sida acuta (S.acu...", "doi": "", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLxx_siJwB4NBm0ytM3Dk_vQvSxTBhV1iAR6sv25Ex2d3ubdWjm9XFcFmHa_3OaFl-BtXBuvwNWE25a6_fMeeCDfrswnsbhgutdr1--efNwWoE4ZyAVGQqNRQP0oNcusaN4UF9Ke9E3JYYSSWjX4GgbOJfhySXYb_ajRSRX9zCwnIw==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "377cdbfcce62"}
{"title": "阿育吠陀 草本古国的灵异医术", "authors": "付琦", "orgs": "", "source": "人与自然", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "", "abstract": "<正>丰润的气候加上肥沃的热带黑土,给印度带来了最为丰富的生物资源。这里是草本植物的天堂,草本运用在这个国度发挥到了极致。阿育吠陀,一门传延数千年的古老医学,以草本治疗为基点,在治疗中崇尚身、心、灵的平衡与健康。古老医学的诞生在古印度,吠陀二字意为知识。印度哲学有四大吠陀:利俱吠陀、夜柔吠陀、沙磨吠陀和阿达婆吠陀。阿育吠陀‘ayurveda’是梵文,由两个字合成:Ayur意指\"生命\",而Veda意为\"知识\",因此按照其字面意思,阿育吠陀为\"生命科学\"。", "doi": "", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLwj3HlRMoI39oROhkW76ppsLYWDdjbmiDp195esBslrfAkrNwKF8Nspk9dXibpScVnuHfywtofTt0kXNp_LUdjxjXpHI-h_eGmecsY11J2fgULtptbt7bo-Z-d0jAEs0uDxGWM3Lpu_jOmX3wRLZClNnkz0LlcgFyI0TjA0atXHBw==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "5b89698e0973"}
{"title": "《印度阿育吠陀药典》所载药物与中国相应传统药物的比较(续)", "authors": "贾敏如 ; 王张 ; 邝婷婷 ; 张艺 ; 成都中医药大学民族医药学院", "orgs": "", "source": "中国民族医药杂志", "year": "2012", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "印度阿育吠陀药典 ; 药物 ; 比较", "abstract": "<正>续《<印度阿育吠陀药典>所载药物与中国相应传统药物的比较(下)》一文,详见表1。本文主要内容提示:《印度阿育吠陀药典》(The Ayurvedic Pharmacopoeia of India,API),由印度政府在1990年～2008年期间出版,共分两部:第一部7卷,共收录单味", "doi": "10.16041/j.cnki.cn15-1175.2012.01.027", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "国家自然科学基金项目(30973957)；", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R93", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=Ef7Li4TQaLzuNHbpPQ7_K0mk1aOFiK2B3sN6HsAIqltlVCadnm4udOofybI_jpaGXHwKlI9SVTezBKOCqYgx0V2SMKd3-E6NH1t4-XRNGWgQgPwKt5nrvb7dAVW2N0NjFnb0iu79AYtjNFst2VHtilMtoM6adAxBzGxcmzmxi_Iv6dF2QORxkQ==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "fa9c967583fa"}
